# Computed

An estimate computed from historic data.

◇

subclass_of_key: method

attributes:
    - key: count
      name: Count
      details: Number of values used in this computation.
      rules: "[0 .. unconstrained] at 1 unit"
      type_spec: Nat
    - key: mean
      name: Mean
      details: Middle of the computed bell curve.
      rules: "[unconstrained .. unconstrained] at 0.01 unit"
      type_spec: Real
    - key: variance
      name: Variance
      details: Shape of the computed bell curve.
      rules: "[0 .. unconstrained] at 0.01 unit"
      type_spec: Real
